  "Each account or phone number works with one conversation at a time. Linking it here moves it from the one it's linked to now.": "每个账户或手机号一次只能用于一个会话。在此关联会把它从当前所关联的会话中移出。",
  "Each Bot has its own browser and files": "每个 Bot 都有自己的浏览器和文件",
  "Each grant is its own row in Audit. Tools that change things are still checked against the boundaries on every call.": "每个授权在审计中都是独立的一行。会改变内容的工具在每次调用时仍会按边界进行检查。",
  "Each person connects their own.": "每个人连接自己的。",
  "Each person has their own computer, and every Bot they use runs on it, public Bots made by other people included. Each Bot keeps its own browser profile and folder there, but a command one Bot runs can reach anything else on that person's computer. An isolated Bot has a computer of its own.": "每个人都有自己的电脑，他们使用的每个 Bot 都运行其上，包括他人制作的公开 Bot。每个 Bot 在该电脑上保留自己的浏览器配置档案和文件夹，但一个 Bot 执行的命令可以触及那台电脑上的其他任何东西。隔离的 Bot 拥有自己的电脑。",
  "Each person keeps their own browser profile and folder for each Bot, so logins aren't shared. A command one Bot runs can still read another's files. Set": "每个人为每个 Bot 保留自己的浏览器配置档案和文件夹，因此登录状态不会共享。一个 Bot 执行的命令仍可读取另一个 Bot 的文件。设置",
  "Each person's computer, and each isolated Bot's. Every Bot keeps its own browser profile on it, which keeps that Bot signed in. Resetting a computer signs every Bot on it out of everything.": "每个人的电脑，以及每个隔离 Bot 的电脑。每个 Bot 在其上保留自己的浏览器配置档案，从而保持该 Bot 的登录状态。重置电脑会让其上的每个 Bot 登出所有服务。",
  "Each person's conversations with it are private.": "每个人与它的会话都是私密的。",
  "Each person's recordings teach Skills in their own Learning space, and those Skills reach the Bots that person uses. A shared Skill puts its person's recorded and narrated text in front of everybody's Bots.": "每个人的录制内容会在其自己的 Learning 空间中教会技能，这些技能会送达该人使用的 Bot。共享的技能会将其所有者的录制文本和旁白文本展示给所有人的 Bot。",
