  "on “": "在“",
  "on a click, counts as a match. Name the tool first so the rest is only checked where it applies:": "在点击时而触发，即算作匹配。请先指定工具名称，这样其余部分只会在适用处检查：",
  "On by default once you start a conversation with just this Bot: it looks through the apps it can already read every four hours, forms memories for you to review and suggests next steps. It can only read: it cannot send messages, change anything in an app, or use a browser or computer. Turn it off or remove it and it stays that way.": "只与这个 Bot 开始对话后默认开启：它每四小时检查一次它已能读取的应用，整理出供你查看的记忆并建议下一步。它只能读取：不能发送消息、不能更改应用中的任何内容，也不能使用浏览器或电脑。关掉或移除它后会一直保持这样。",
  "On. A matching action goes ahead and is recorded in Audit, so you can see what a rule catches before it stops anything.": "开启。匹配的操作会继续执行并记录在审计中，这样你可以在规则真正拦截之前看到它会捕获什么。",
  "On. The Recorder hears your microphone while you record, so say what you're doing as you go.": "开启。录制时 Recorder 会拾取你的麦克风，所以请边说边讲你在做什么。",
  "On. The Recorder in your browser listens to your microphone while you record, and turns your speech into text on your computer.": "开启。录制时，浏览器中的 Recorder 会监听你的麦克风，并在你的电脑上把语音转成文字。",
