  "Show computer": "显示电脑",
  "Show how a whole is divided, as a donut with a legend. Use only when the parts sum to something meaningful, and prefer a bar chart above about six slices.": "以带图例的环形图展示整体如何被划分。仅当各部分相加有实际意义时使用，切片超过约六个时优先使用柱状图。",
