  "Show the container for": "显示对应的容器",
  "Show up to six headline figures, each with an optional movement. Use for a summary somebody reads at a glance.": "最多展示六个标题数字，每个可选带变化。用于让人一眼读完的摘要。",
  "Show values against their targets as progress bars. Use for 'are we there yet' questions, budget spent against budget, done against planned.": "以进度条展示数值相对其目标的情况。用于「我们到了吗」这类问题、已花预算对比预算、已完成对比计划。",
  "Show values as a bar chart. Use when comparing a handful of named things, teams, months, categories. Not for a trend over time, which is showLineChart.": "以柱状图展示数值。在比较少数几个有名的事物、团队、月份、类别时使用。不用于随时间变化的趋势，那种情况用 showLineChart。",
  "Show voice call": "显示语音通话",
