  "The coworkers that already exist here, one line each, with whose each one is and where it runs. Read this before proposing a coworker: the most expensive mistake this job can make is rebuilding one somebody already maintains.": "这里已存在的同事，每位一行，并标明各自属于谁、在哪里运行。提议一位同事之前先读它：这份工作可能犯的最昂贵的错误，就是重建别人已经在维护的东西。",
  "The data this component can fetch to draw itself. This is separate from Available to. With all of these off, it shows only what the Bot passes it. Every read shows in Audit. Changes apply right away.": "此组件可用于绘制自身的数据。这与「可用对象」是分开的。全部关闭时，它只显示 Bot 传给它的内容。每次读取都会显示在审计中。更改立即生效。",
  "The deployment registers its redirect URI itself. There is nothing to add at the vendor.": "部署会自行注册其重定向 URI。无需在供应商处添加任何内容。",
  "The desktop app is offline. Open it to approve folders or run commands.": "桌面应用已离线。打开它即可审批文件夹或运行命令。",
  "The file from your identity team. It includes the signing certificate.": "来自你身份团队的文件，其中包含签名证书。",
  "The file has the newest": "该文件拥有最新内容",
  "The form had invalid questions. The Bot can send a corrected form.": "表单中存在无效问题。Bot 可以发送修正后的表单。",
  "The form has invalid questions, so it can't be shown.": "表单中存在无效问题，因此无法显示。",
  "The OpenBot desktop app still shows you each command before it runs.": "OpenBot 桌面应用仍会在每条命令运行前展示给你。",
  "The output was too long. This is the end of it.": "输出太长了。这里是它的结尾。",
  "The report contains the current quarter's graph and a source link.": "报告包含当前季度的图表和一个来源链接。",
  "The rule": "该规则",
  "The same as showLineChart with the area under each line filled. Use for volume or accumulation rather than for a rate.": "与 showLineChart 相同，但每条线下方的区域会被填充。用于总量或累积，而不是速率。",
  "The sample arguments aren't available.": "示例参数不可用。",
  "The site sent a verification code. Enter it to finish signing in.": "网站已发送验证码。输入验证码以完成登录。",
  "The Skills I choose": "我选择的技能",
  "The skills that already exist in this deployment, one line each, with whose each one is. Read this before writing a skill: a slug is an identity, so reusing one replaces that skill, and a slug that is not the person's own cannot be replaced at all.": "这个部署中已存在的技能，每项一行，并标明各自属于谁。编写技能之前先读它：slug 就是身份，复用同一个会替换掉那项技能，而不属于该用户自己的 slug 根本无法被替换。",
  "The skills that could be put on a new coworker, by slug. Putting a skill on a coworker is the only capability the card grants: a skill is an instruction, so one naming a tool the coworker was not granted simply loads nothing.": "可以装到新同事身上的技能，按 slug 列出。把技能装到同事身上，是这张卡片授予的唯一能力：技能就是一条指令，所以若它指定了该同事未被授予的工具，就只是加载不到任何东西。",
  "The standard look, with your conversations in a sidebar.": "标准外观，会话显示在侧边栏中。",
  "The strictest matching rule wins. An \"ask\" rule beats an \"allow\" rule. Rules for every Bot are in": "最严格的匹配规则优先。「询问」规则优先于「允许」规则。所有 Bot 的规则位于",
  "The strictest matching rule wins. An \"ask\" rule beats an \"allow\" rule. Team rules are locked. Passwords, security settings and payments are always handed to you. Rules for one Bot are on": "最严格的匹配规则优先。「询问」规则优先于「允许」规则。团队规则已锁定。密码、安全设置和支付始终交由你处理。单个 Bot 的规则位于",
